远端关 channel 或本地拆除后，状态机进入 .closedLocally / .closed，但缓冲里还有
入站数据要投递。父 socket 的 channelReadComplete 经 tryToRead（isActiveOnChannel
对这两个状态返回 true）走到 deliverSingleRead：排空数据腾出窗口，于是构造
CHANNEL_WINDOW_ADJUST，sendChannelWindowAdjust 对已关闭状态 preconditionFailure，
在 event-loop 线程上 abort 整个进程（uTerm 1.6.0 线上崩溃）。

deliverSingleRead 的 .data 分支多判断 !state.sentClose。apple/swift-nio-ssh 现行
实现就是这么修的；Wellz26 的 fork 是修复前的快照。
---
 Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift b/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift
index 0f30423..c9c62a3 100644
--- a/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift	
+++ b/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift	
@@ -650,7 +650,12 @@ private extension SSHChildChannel {
         switch data {
         case .data(let data):
             // We only futz with the window manager if the channel is not already closed.
-            if !self.didClose, let increment = self.windowManager.unbufferBytes(data.data.readableBytes) {
+            // uTerm patch: also skip when we've sent CHANNEL_CLOSE (state .closedLocally/.closed).
+            // Draining buffered reads while in a closed-locally state would otherwise emit a
+            // CHANNEL_WINDOW_ADJUST, which the state machine rejects with a preconditionFailure
+            // ("Sent channel window adjust on channel in invalid state") and crashes the process.
+            // This mirrors the `!self.state.sentClose` guard added in upstream apple/swift-nio-ssh.
+            if !self.didClose, !self.state.sentClose, let increment = self.windowManager.unbufferBytes(data.data.readableBytes) {
                 let update = SSHMessage.ChannelWindowAdjustMessage(recipientChannel: self.state.remoteChannelIdentifier!, bytesToAdd: UInt32(increment))
                 self.processOutboundMessage(.channelWindowAdjust(update), promise: nil)
             }
